<title>USA: Comsat names chief technical officer.</title>
<headline>Comsat names chief technical officer.</headline>
<dateline>BETHESDA, Md. 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Comsat Corp said on Tuesday it named John Evans to the newly created post of chief technical officer.</p>
<p>Evans had been head of Comsat Laboratories since 1983, the company said.</p>
<p>Benjamin Pontano has been appointed acting president of Comsat Laboratories, Comsat said.</p>
<p>Comsat said the changes were made to take advantage of the technology developed by Comsat Laboratories as the company expands into new areas of satellite communications services and products.</p>
</text>
